# Passive Refleja: Plural Human Object without 'a'
<!-- id: c1_passive_refleja_necesitan | level: C1 | topic: passive_refleja | type: cloze -->

> **Grammar Rule**: If a plural noun represents people but has no personal 'a' (expressing a category or requirement), the construction is passive 'se' and the verb must be plural.

### Context
English: "Volunteers are needed."

### Exercise
Se (necesitar) ___ voluntarios.

<!-- SOLUTION
necesitan
-->

